                <div class="servInfo">
                    <span>Service 1</span>
                    <h1>StoneWorks</h1>
                    <p>Transform your outdoor living spaces with our premium custom stoneworks. We carefully design and build elegant retaining walls, grand patios, and fire pits that blend timeless beauty with structural permanence.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="servImage">
                    <!-- Above the fold: no lazy loading -->
                    <img src="https://q8w2ldusbcmjarkb.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/images/stairs.png" alt="">
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="bottomInfo">
                <div class="bIleft">
                    <h1>We utilize premium freeze-thaw resistant natural stones perfectly engineered for harsh Canadian winter climates.</h1>
                </div>
                <div class="bIright">
                    <p>Our expert masons handcraft visually striking landscapes, ensuring every single stone adds immense value and unmatched character to your property.</p>
                    <span>STONEWORKS</span>
                </div>
            </div>
            <!-- Above the fold: no lazy loading -->
            <img class="shapes s1" src="/static/shapes/topleft.png" alt="">
