            <div class="servHeadliner">
                <div class="servInfo">
                    <span>Service 5</span>
                    <h1>ConcreteWorks</h1>
                    <p>As trusted industry leaders, we bring ambitious architectural ideas to reality. From robust foundational slabs to decorative epoxy flooring, our master craftsmanship ensures unyielding strength alongside truly breathtaking visual detailing.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="servImage">
                    <img src="https://q8w2ldusbcmjarkb.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/images/concretestairs.png" alt="" loading="lazy">
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="bottomInfo">
                <div class="bIleft">
                    <h1>Our advanced curing compounds guarantee a remarkably dense finish that blocks harsh stains.</h1>
